@@ -1,6 +1,28 @@
+---
+# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+# Self-Heal and Diagnostics — POSIX-native (RUN #73 RECOVERY)
+#
+# INCIDENT: run "Self-Heal and Diagnostics #73" failed at
+#   "Ensure PowerShell self-heal script is present" with exit code 127:
+#     /home/runner/work/_temp/....sh: line 1: powershell: command not found
+#
+# ROOT CAUSE: the step invoked the Windows `powershell` CLI inline from the
+# default Linux runner shell (`/usr/bin/bash`). `powershell` (Windows
+# PowerShell 5.1) does not exist on ubuntu-latest at all, and even PowerShell
+# Core is exposed as `pwsh`, never `powershell`. The call was therefore
+# guaranteed to fail with 127 on every single run.
+#
+# FIX: all verification and execution is now native POSIX Bash. The
+# PowerShell script (scripts/self_heal.ps1) is PRESERVED unchanged for
